  "steps": [
    "Add the blueberries to a pan with zero calorie sweetener and lemon zest. Simmer for 7 to 8 minutes until the compote becomes thick and jammy, with no watery liquid remaining. Let it cool completely.",
    "Mix the cooled blueberry compote into the Epigamia Turbo Protein Yogurt.",
    "Transfer the mixture into a muslin cloth, tie it securely and place a heavy weight on top. Let all the excess water drain until the yogurt becomes very thick.",
    "Scoop the thickened blueberry yogurt into a bowl using an ice cream scoop.",
    "Dry roast the walnuts in a pan until crunchy. Add a pinch of salt and cinnamon and mix.",
    "Switch off the heat, add the honey and stir for around 2 minutes until the walnuts are coated.",
    "Spread the walnuts out and let them air dry for 5 to 10 minutes until crunchy.",
    "Crush the honey coated walnuts and sprinkle them over the blueberry yogurt.",
    "Top with coconut chips, honey and serve chilled."
  ],
